you tell me what time the hermit party is, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w20-0031\", \"v\": [[\"pics w Griffin Ashdown in them?\"], [\"Griffin Ashdown photos\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w20-0032\", \"v\": [[\"Could you please show me the photos from Discombe Leisure Centre?\", \"Thank you — how many are there altogether?\"], [\"Discombe Leisure Centre shots\", \"how many total?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w20-0033\", \"v\": [[\"Regarding Marrette in Bovmawen, would you mind helping me settle up, please?\"], [\"marrette in bovmawen, wanna settle up\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w20-0034\", \"v\": [[\"I sorted the tickets ahead of time so I paid for them — can you add 60 pounds for Marrette's tickets to Bovmawen?\", \"Totally unrelated, but I've been meaning to tidy my address book — how many people have I actually got in my contacts?\", \"Huh, fewer than I expected. And while you're at it, what did the parts come to?\"], [\"add 60 pounds for Marrette's tickets to Bovmawen, i paid\", \"also how many ppl r in my contacts\", \"and what did the parts come to\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w20-0035\", \"v\": [[\"Could you list the Samarkand expenses, please?\", \"Hang on, before I forget — which documents have I starred?\", \"Thank you. Going back to the Samarkand expenses, could you show me only the ones more than thirty five pounds?\", \"And could you tell me what the repair came to?\"], [\"I'm trying to reconcile who paid for what, so can you list the Samarkand expenses for me?\", \"Oh hang on, random question while I remember — which documents did I star? I marked a few important ones a while back.\", \"Ok, right, back to the Samarkand stuff — I only really care about the bigger ones, so just the ones more than thirty five pounds.\", \"Great, and what did the repair come to? I've a feeling someone overpaid on that.\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w20-0036\", \"v\": [[\"I'm finally signing up at the gym online and I'm hopeless at these, so could you come up with a password for the gym account?\", \"Different thing — I'm tidying up my files, so can you find my granary paperwork?\", \"And what do my expenses have on it? I want to check whether I've paid for that already.\"], [\"umm can you make up a password for my… my gym account?\", \"ok different thing, uh, can you find my granary paperwork?\", \"and um, what do my expenses say about it?\"]]}","ttft_ms":24856,"type":"result","duration_ms":37671,"uuid":"0f92fe61-5cd0-4a9b-a1bd-78fe221f1952","ttft_stream_ms":1390,"time_to_request_ms":172,"first_content_frame_ms":1390,"time_to_request_from_spawn_ms":22196536,"warm_spare_claimed":false,"time_origin_ms":1790278746999.3848,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
